Since v2.0.0 the formerly separate, independently licensed component Skills
(adaptive-model-router, scholarly-corpus-builder, scholarly-voice-engine,
journal-fit-engine) are merged into this repository as modules under
skills/scholarly-agent/modules/<name>/. Since v2.4.0 their original copyright
notices are collected in skills/scholarly-agent/LICENSE (one file instead of
one per module, to keep the Skill package small); this top-level license covers the
Suite's own code (the scholarly-agent dispatcher, protocols/, shared/,
workflows/, scripts/, tests/, evals/) and does not relicense those modules.
